  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://bpsc.bihar.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Bihar Public Service Commission (BPSC)</a> </span>has released the final answer key for the post of Assistant Section Officer ASO (Sahaayak Prashaakha Padaadhikaaree) (Advt.No:37/2025). This recruitment was released for 41 posts. Applications for the BPSC ASO Recruitment 2025 were accepted from January 12, 2026, to January 31, 2026. The mains examination was conducted on 27 February 2026. Candidates <span data-teams=\"true\"> who appeared for this examination</span> can download their BPSC ASO Mains Admit Card 2026 from the link given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Bihar Public Service Commission (BPSC)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">BPSC ASO Final Answer Key 2026</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">BPSC MOD Advt. No. 37/2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Notification Date : <strong>22 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>29 May 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>23 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Fee Payment Last Date : <strong>23 June 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>10 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Admit Card : <strong>04 September 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Answer Key : <strong>18 September 2025&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pre OMR Sheet :&nbsp;<strong>22-28 October 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pre Final Answer Key : <strong>01 November 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Pre Result : <strong>23 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"background-color: #ffff00; font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Mains Online Form</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Start Date : <strong>12 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date : <strong>31 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Exam Date : <strong>27 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Admit Card : <strong>20 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Final Answer Key : <strong>06 April 2026</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, OBC, EWS, Other Candidates : <strong>Rs. 600/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST, Female Candidates of Bihar : <strong>Rs. 150/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">PH Candidates :&nbsp;<strong>Rs. 200/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates have to pay their Examination Fee Through Debit Card / Credit Card / Net Banking / UPI and Other Fee Payment Mode Only.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BPSC ASO Mains Notification 2026 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\">Age Limit As On 01 August 2025</span></strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Minimum Age :&nbsp;<strong>21 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>37 Years (Male)&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>40 Years (Female UR, BC, EBC Male &amp; Female)&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Maximum Age :&nbsp;<strong>42 Years (SC, ST Male &amp; Female)</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per BPSC Assistant Section Officer ASO Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Use <span style=\"color: #000000; background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BPSC ASO Mains Online Form 2026 : Vacancy Details</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Total Posts : 41 Posts</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.3851%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Category&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.1028%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>No. of Post&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 47.3851%; text-align: center;\" rowspan=\"7\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Assistant Section Officer ASO</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General&nbsp;</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.1028%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">16</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EWS</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.1028%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">04</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">EBC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.1028%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">09</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">BC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.1028%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">01</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">BC-Female</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.1028%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">01</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.1028%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">09</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 26.512%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">ST</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 26.1028%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">01</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>BPSC ASO Mains Online Form 2026 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Candidates Having Graduation Degree in any stream from any recognized university / institute will be eligible for this recruitment.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>How To Download BPSC ASO Final Answer Key 2026</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Check the Important Links section.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then click on the Download Final Answer Key link.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">After clicking on the link, candidates will be redirected to the Dashboard page.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">In this page candidates have to fill up the following fields with proper details:</span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Candidate’s Registration Number</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Date of Birth</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Gender</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Verification Code</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Then the candidates will be required to submit the details in order to download the mains final answer key.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">The candidate can also download their final answer key download from the official Website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>BPSC Assistant Section Officer ASO Recruitment 2025 : Mode of Selection</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Preliminary Examination</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Mains Examination</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Interview&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Document Verification</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><sp